1
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:09,760
Read the lesson together with teacher.

2
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,120
The Baby Otter Goes to School

3
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:23,640
The baby otter is very lazy to study, refuses to go to school.

4
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:31,760
Your friends go to school, no one plays with the baby otter.

5
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:42,560
The baby otter follows the butterfly swarm, runs deep into the forest.

6
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:49,280
It cannot find the way out.

7
00:00:50,080 --> 00:01:03,840
In the forest there is a signboard but the baby otter cannot read so cannot read it.

8
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:12,480
Mr. Lion sees that, brings the baby otter home.

9
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:20,560
After that, the baby otter studies very hard.

